        "original_id": "7f39bdc9-b63c-5c24-8740-b59b204f13f2",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Films: A Perfect Murder, Dial M for Murder, 3 A.M., Gloria\n- People: Andrew Davis, Michael Douglas, Gwyneth Paltrow, Viggo Mortensen, Alfred Hitchcock, Ray Milland, Grace Kelly, Robert Cummings, John Williams, Sarita Choudhury, John Cassavetes\n\nFacts:\n- Dial M for Murder is a 1954 American crime mystery film directed by Alfred Hitchcock and starring Ray Milland, Grace Kelly, Robert Cummings, and John Williams.\n- A Perfect Murder is a 1998 American crime thriller film directed by Andrew Davis and starring Michael Douglas, Gwyneth Paltrow, and Viggo Mortensen.\n- In the late 1990s, Sarita Choudhury had supporting roles in A Perfect Murder, 3 A.M., and Gloria.\n- Gloria is described as a John Cassavetes retread.",
